{"sections":[{"slug":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为单纯图表的余极限</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何实现 (作为单纯图表的余极限)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现有两种不同的含义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">本页面介绍的是其作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯图表</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的余极限的含义</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为米田扩张</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":" $|X|$, "},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">就是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中的单纯图表</span>\n$$\r\n\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Set}\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Ani}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">于是对于一般的</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">人们也称这种形状的余极限为几何实现</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这实际上是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为米田扩张</span>)"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的特例</span>: $\\mathsf{Ani}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中所有的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">单形</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">实际上都是一个点</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的几何实现指的就是单纯图表的余极限</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span> $X\\colon \\Delta^{\\text{op}}\\to\\mathsf {Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">中的余极限是</span> $\\pi_0(X)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}